Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:50:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] WIP: Access 9.2 A-7: test_access_work rooms for W1 to W7

The work beats' rooms (halls A to C, Amy, Dana, Omar and the copy room, Kai,
Ian and the temp office, Nia), roles, resources, the default mutter pools and
one task per beat. validate_npc_needs skips other NPCs' desks as targets of a
judged need. Incomplete: PLAYTEST.md has no W section yet, the W runs are
part done (W1, W2 pass), and A-4's validator checks and the Kai warning are
not built.
